WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.180
Let's seek the Lord together on day number five.

2
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.340
Father, we praise you today

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.800
for revealing holiness to us, not just as unapproachable

4
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.600
light where we would be convinced that we could never be

5
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.040
holy.

6
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.940
We can never be a spirit like you with all power and all

7
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:29.500
knowledge.

8
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.300
We can never be holy in human form, and yet you have showed

9
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.920
us and revealed to us

10
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.460
that humanity and holiness can coexist

11
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.180
in the name and in the person of your son, Jesus.

12
00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.720
So Lord, we have one deep, supreme desire

13
00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.840
that we might be like Jesus.

14
00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.460
I praise you, Lord, for my prayer partner who is here praying with me

15
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.080
today. I praise you for the desire that you've put within us

16
00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.340
to be like Jesus. Like David said, "When I awake, I will be

17
00:01:05.481 --> 00:01:07.120
satisfied with your likeness."

18
00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.920
Oh God, we want to be like Christ. We want to keep our mind

19
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:16.140
fixed and stayed upon him, not focusing on ourselves or

20
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:16.620
our own

21
00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:19.920
lack of strength, our own lack of ability.

22
00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:24.720
Lord, we've looked for too long at ourselves and never

23
00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.260
seen anything good happen by just looking at ourselves.

24
00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.180
But we look to Jesus today

25
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.460
as the source and the definition of holiness.

26
00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:36.980
Oh God, help us to look up to him and be

27
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:40.260
changed into his image with ever-increasing glory.

28
00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:44.680
Thank you, Father, for showing us what human holiness really does look

29
00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:48.680
like, and we rest upon that. We trust in it today.

30
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.580
We ask that the Holy Spirit would use the image

31
00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:56.660
and the picture of Jesus to inspire us and help us long

32
00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:00.640
for holiness today. Thank you, Jesus, for being our supreme

33
00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:01.160
example.

34
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:06.190
Let's continue to pray together and ask the Lord to bless and

35
00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.361
work in our hearts as we pray.
